.TH TDE\-MIXER\-TRAY 1 "November 2026" "tde-mixer 0.1.0" "Trinity Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
tde\-mixer\-tray \- volume control in the TDE system tray
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tde\-mixer\-tray
.RI [ "generic TDE and TQt options" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tde\-mixer\-tray
shows the volume of the default output device in the system tray of the
Kicker panel and replaces the tray icon of
.BR kmix (1).
It works with PipeWire and PulseAudio, using the backend chosen in the
settings of
.BR tde\-mixer (1).
.PP
.TP
.B Left click
opens a window with the volume of the default output device and of each
application that plays sound, and a button to open the full mixer.
.TP
.B Middle click
mutes or unmutes the default output device.
.TP
.B Mouse wheel
changes the volume of the default output device by the volume step
(5 % by default).
.TP
.B Right click
opens a menu to open the mixer, choose the default output device, mute,
configure the volume control and its shortcuts, and turn the autostart
at login on or off.
.PP
While it runs, the keyboard's volume keys (XF86AudioRaiseVolume,
XF86AudioLowerVolume, XF86AudioMute) change the default output device and
XF86AudioMicMute mutes the default input device. The keys can be changed
with
.B Configure Shortcuts
in the menu.
.PP
Only one instance runs per session; starting it again does nothing.
.SH AUTOSTART
The icon is started at login by default. Unchecking
.B Start Automatically at Login
in its menu, or the matching setting in the Control Center module, sets
.B Autostart=false
in the
.B [General]
group of
.IR tde\-mixer\-trayrc .
.SH KMIX
When it starts for the first time and KMix is set to start at login, it
asks once whether KMix should be turned off. If you agree, it sets
.B Autostart=false
in the
.B [General]
group of
.I kmixrc
and quits a running KMix. KMix stays installed. The question is not asked
when
.B ReplaceKMix=false
is set in
.IR tde\-mixerrc .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.trinity/share/config/tde\-mixer\-trayrc
.B [General] Autostart
(default true),
.B KMixChecked
(the KMix question was asked).
.TP
.I ~/.trinity/share/config/tde\-mixerrc
Shared settings, see
.BR tde\-mixer (1).
.TP
.I /opt/trinity/share/autostart/tde\-mixer\-tray\-autostart.desktop
Session autostart entry, guarded by
.BR X\-TDE\-autostart\-condition=tde\-mixer\-trayrc:General:Autostart:true .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tde\-mixer (1),
.BR kmix (1),
.BR pipewire (1),
.BR pulseaudio (1)
.PP
The handbook is available in the TDE Help Center
.RI ( help:/tde\-mixer/tray.html ).
